# Copy to signing.env (it's git-ignored) and fill in, then run `make run`.
# See "Signing and passkeys" in the README.

# The certificate to sign with, as `security find-identity -v -p codesigning` lists it.
FOCUS_SIGN_IDENTITY="Apple Development: Your Name (ABCDE12345)"

# The macOS provisioning profile for Focus's App ID, downloaded from the developer portal.
FOCUS_PROVISIONING_PROFILE="$HOME/Downloads/Focus.provisionprofile"
